---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Seattle Web Design Agency | Right Framework Digital Inc."
  description="Right Framework is a Seattle web design agency building fast, SEO-optimized websites for small businesses across the Pacific Northwest. Get found on Google and grow."
  canonicalURL="https://www.rightframework.tech/"
>

<!-- NAV -->
<header class="nav" id="nav">
  <div class="wrap nav-inner">
    <a href="/" class="logo" aria-label="Right Framework">
      <svg class="logo-img" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="32" height="32" rx="8" fill="#111"/><path d="M8 8h10a4 4 0 0 1 0 8H8V8z" fill="#fff"/><path d="M8 16h7l5 8h-4l-4-6.5V24H8V16z" fill="#fff"/></svg>
      <span>Right Framework</span>
    </a>
    <ul class="nav-links" role="list" aria-label="Main navigation">
      <li><a href="#services">Services</a></li>
      <li><a href="#process">Process</a></li>
      <li><a href="#work">Work</a></li>
      <li><a href="/blog">Blog</a></li>
      <li><a href="#contact" class="nav-cta">Get in touch</a></li>
      <li><a href="tel:+13014335323" class="nav-call" aria-label="Call us"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07A19.5 19.5 0 0 1 4.69 12 19.79 19.79 0 0 1 1.62 3.42 2 2 0 0 1 3.6 1.24h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72c.127.96.361 1.903.7 2.81a2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L7.91 8.82a16 16 0 0 0 6.29 6.29l.95-.95a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45c.907.339 1.85.573 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"/></svg></a></li>
    </ul>
    <button class="burger" id="burger" aria-label="Open menu" aria-expanded="false">
      <span></span><span></span>
    </button>
  </div>
  <div class="nav-drawer" id="drawer" hidden>
    <div class="wrap">
      <a href="#services">Services</a>
      <a href="#process">Process</a>
      <a href="#work">Work</a>
      <a href="/blog">Blog</a>
      <a href="#contact">Get in touch</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<main>

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="hero-grid">
      <div class="hero-text">
        <p class="kicker">Seattle Web Studio</p>
        <h1>We build websites<br><em>that bring customers.</em></h1>
        <p class="hero-sub">Right Framework helps small businesses across the Pacific Northwest get more visibility, more traffic, and more customers — with modern, SEO-optimized websites built to perform.</p>
        <div class="hero-btns">
          <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-blue btn-lg">Get a free consultation</a>
          <a href="#work" class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg">See our work</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-visual" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="hero-frame">
          <img
            src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/3182812/pexels-photo-3182812.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1200&h=900&fit=crop"
            alt=""
            width="600"
            height="480"
            loading="eager"
            fetchpriority="high"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="float float-a">
          <strong>+142%</strong>
          <span>Organic traffic</span>
        </div>
        <div class="float float-b">
          <strong>1.2s</strong>
          <span>Avg. load time</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- STATS BAR -->
<div class="stats-bar">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="stats-row">
      <div class="stat">
        <strong>50+</strong>
        <span>Projects delivered</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-sep" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="stat">
        <strong>3×</strong>
        <span>Avg. traffic growth</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-sep" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="stat">
        <strong>Seattle</strong>
        <span>Based &amp; operated</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-sep" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="stat">
        <strong>Since 2020</strong>
        <span>Serving clients</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- PULL QUOTE -->
<section class="pullquote-section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <blockquote class="pullquote">
      <p>Most small business websites in Seattle are invisible on Google and fail to convert the visitors they do get.</p>
      <p class="pullquote-end">We fix both.</p>
    </blockquote>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- VALUE PROPS -->
<section class="props-section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="props-grid">
      <div class="prop">
        <div class="prop-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><path d="M9 9h6M9 12h6M9 15h4"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Modern Design</h3>
        <p>Purposeful interfaces that guide visitors toward action — not just something that looks nice.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="prop">
        <div class="prop-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><path d="m21 21-4.35-4.35"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>SEO Built In</h3>
        <p>Technical SEO, semantic markup, and local keyword targeting baked into every project from day one.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="prop">
        <div class="prop-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75"><rect x="5" y="2" width="14" height="20" rx="2"/><line x1="12" y1="18" x2="12.01" y2="18" stroke-width="2.5"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Mobile-First</h3>
        <p>60% of searches happen on phones. We build for that reality — fast and pixel-perfect everywhere.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="prop">
        <div class="prop-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75"><polyline points="22 7 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 2 17"/><polyline points="16 7 22 7 22 13"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Converts Visitors</h3>
        <p>Layouts structured around real customer psychology — turning traffic into calls and leads.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- SERVICES -->
<section class="services-section" id="services">
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="sec-head">
      <p class="label">What we do</p>
      <h2>Services for Seattle small businesses</h2>
    </header>

    <div class="svc-list">
      <article class="svc-row">
        <div class="svc-label">
          <span class="svc-num">01</span>
          <h3>Website Design &amp; Development</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="svc-body">
          <p>Custom websites for Seattle small businesses — built fast and clean. Not a template, not a page builder. A real website designed around your customers and optimized to rank.</p>
          <ul class="svc-features">
            <li>Custom design tailored to your brand</li>
            <li>Responsive, mobile-first build</li>
            <li>Performance-optimized code</li>
            <li>Content management ready</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="svc-row">
        <div class="svc-label">
          <span class="svc-num">02</span>
          <h3>UI/UX Design</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="svc-body">
          <p>Good UX means fewer questions and more calls. We map how your customers actually navigate and design around that — reducing friction, improving clarity, and making the next step obvious.</p>
          <ul class="svc-features">
            <li>User flow mapping</li>
            <li>Wireframes and prototypes</li>
            <li>Conversion rate optimization</li>
            <li>Accessibility compliance</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="svc-row">
        <div class="svc-label">
          <span class="svc-num">03</span>
          <h3>SEO-Optimized Development</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="svc-body">
          <p>Most agencies add SEO after the fact. We build with it in mind from day one — technical markup, structured data, local keyword targeting, and Core Web Vitals all handled before launch.</p>
          <ul class="svc-features">
            <li>Technical SEO foundation</li>
            <li>On-page keyword integration</li>
            <li>Local SEO for Seattle &amp; Pacific NW</li>
            <li>Google Search Console setup</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="svc-row">
        <div class="svc-label">
          <span class="svc-num">04</span>
          <h3>Redesign &amp; Performance</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="svc-body">
          <p>Your existing site isn't broken — it's just not working. We audit what's underperforming and fix it: speed, rankings, structure, conversions. Real improvements without starting from zero.</p>
          <ul class="svc-features">
            <li>Full site audit and analysis</li>
            <li>Speed and Core Web Vitals fixes</li>
            <li>SEO recovery and improvement</li>
            <li>UX redesign and modernization</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- PROCESS -->
<section class="process-section" id="process">
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="sec-head sec-head-inv">
      <p class="label label-inv">How we work</p>
      <h2>Clear process.<br>No surprises.</h2>
    </header>
    <div class="process-grid">
      <div class="process-card">
        <span class="process-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span>
        <h3>Discovery</h3>
        <p>We learn your business, your customers, and what winning looks like for you. Then we dig into your Seattle market — competitor research, keyword mapping, the real opportunities.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="process-card">
        <span class="process-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span>
        <h3>Design &amp; Build</h3>
        <p>Every design and code decision is made with SEO and conversions already in mind. You review at every stage. Nothing ships without your sign-off.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="process-card">
        <span class="process-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span>
        <h3>Launch &amp; Grow</h3>
        <p>We submit to Google, wire up analytics, and watch the first few weeks closely. Your investment should start working immediately — and we make sure it does.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- WHY US -->
<section class="why-section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="why-grid">
      <div class="why-left">
        <p class="label">Why Right Framework</p>
        <h2>We know Seattle small business better than anyone</h2>
        <p>We're not a marketplace, not an offshore shop, and not a generalist agency. We work with a small number of Pacific Northwest businesses at a time so we can actually pay attention.</p>
        <p>That means you deal directly with the people building your site, and every decision is made with your specific market and customers in mind.</p>
        <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-blue btn-lg" style="margin-top: 8px;">Start a conversation</a>
      </div>
      <div class="why-right">
        <div class="why-item">
          <div class="why-check" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <strong>Direct access, no account managers</strong>
            <p>You work with the people writing your code, not a go-between.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="why-item">
          <div class="why-check" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <strong>Pacific Northwest only</strong>
            <p>We focus on Washington State businesses. That specificity shows in the results.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="why-item">
          <div class="why-check" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <strong>SEO and design aren't two separate things</strong>
            <p>We treat them as the same problem. Most studios don't.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="why-item">
          <div class="why-check" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <strong>Measured by your results, not deliverables</strong>
            <p>We track rankings, leads, and load times — not just "launched."</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- WORK -->
<section class="work-section" id="work">
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="sec-head">
      <p class="label">Selected work</p>
      <h2>Recent Pacific Northwest projects</h2>
    </header>

    <!-- Filter tabs -->
    <div class="work-filters" role="tablist" aria-label="Filter projects by category">
      <button class="filter-btn active" data-filter="all" role="tab" aria-selected="true">All Projects</button>
      <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="construction" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Construction &amp; Trades</button>
      <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="health" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Health &amp; Wellness</button>
      <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="retail" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Retail &amp; Restaurants</button>
      <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="ecommerce" role="tab" aria-selected="false">E-Commerce</button>
    </div>

    <div class="work-grid" id="workGrid">

      <!-- Construction & Trades: Prime View Glass -->
      <article class="work-card" data-category="construction">
        <div class="work-preview">
          <div class="iframe-wrapper">
            <iframe
              src="https://www.primeviewglass.com"
              title="Prime View Glass website preview"
              loading="lazy"
              scrolling="no"
              tabindex="-1"
              aria-hidden="true"
            ></iframe>
          </div>
          <a href="https://www.primeviewglass.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="preview-overlay" aria-label="Visit Prime View Glass website"></a>
        </div>
        <div class="work-info">
          <span class="work-tag">Construction &amp; Trades</span>
          <h3>Prime View Glass</h3>
          <p>Glass railing installation for residential and commercial clients in Seattle, WA. Conversion-first site built to turn local search traffic into booked estimates.</p>
          <a href="https://www.primeviewglass.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-blue work-visit-btn">Visit Site &rarr;</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Construction & Trades: Asian Contractors -->
      <article class="work-card" data-category="construction">
        <div class="work-preview">
          <div class="iframe-wrapper">
            <iframe
              src="https://www.asiancontractors.ca"
              title="Asian Contractors website preview"
              loading="lazy"
              scrolling="no"
              tabindex="-1"
              aria-hidden="true"
            ></iframe>
          </div>
          <a href="https://www.asiancontractors.ca" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="preview-overlay" aria-label="Visit Asian Contractors website"></a>
        </div>
        <div class="work-info">
          <span class="work-tag">Construction &amp; Trades</span>
          <h3>Asian Contractors</h3>
          <p>General contracting company serving the Vancouver/BC market. Built for local SEO and lead generation to bring in consistent inquiries.</p>
          <a href="https://www.asiancontractors.ca" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-blue work-visit-btn">Visit Site &rarr;</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Health & Wellness: Coming Soon -->
      <article class="work-card work-card-soon" data-category="health">
        <div class="work-soon-body">
          <div class="soon-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <span class="work-tag">Health &amp; Wellness</span>
          <h3>Project Coming Soon</h3>
          <p>We're currently working on an exciting Health &amp; Wellness project. Check back soon to see the full case study.</p>
          <span class="soon-badge">Coming Soon</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Retail & Restaurants: Old Durbar -->
      <article class="work-card" data-category="retail">
        <div class="work-preview">
          <div class="iframe-wrapper">
            <iframe
              src="https://www.olddurbar.ca"
              title="Old Durbar website preview"
              loading="lazy"
              scrolling="no"
              tabindex="-1"
              aria-hidden="true"
            ></iframe>
          </div>
          <a href="https://www.olddurbar.ca" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="preview-overlay" aria-label="Visit Old Durbar website"></a>
        </div>
        <div class="work-info">
          <span class="work-tag">Retail &amp; Restaurants</span>
          <h3>Old Durbar</h3>
          <p>Authentic Nepali restaurant website. Location-targeted design to capture local search and drive foot traffic and reservations.</p>
          <a href="https://www.olddurbar.ca" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-blue work-visit-btn">Visit Site &rarr;</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Retail & Restaurants: Momo n Grill -->
      <article class="work-card" data-category="retail">
        <div class="work-preview">
          <div class="iframe-wrapper">
            <iframe
              src="https://momongrill.ca"
              title="Momo n Grill website preview"
              loading="lazy"
              scrolling="no"
              tabindex="-1"
              aria-hidden="true"
            ></iframe>
          </div>
          <a href="https://momongrill.ca" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="preview-overlay" aria-label="Visit Momo n Grill website"></a>
        </div>
        <div class="work-info">
          <span class="work-tag">Retail &amp; Restaurants</span>
          <h3>Momo n Grill</h3>
          <p>Restaurant website built to attract local diners and drive online orders. Clean, appetizing design optimized for local search visibility.</p>
          <a href="https://momongrill.ca" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-blue work-visit-btn">Visit Site &rarr;</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- E-Commerce: Moksha Candles -->
      <article class="work-card" data-category="ecommerce">
        <div class="work-preview">
          <div class="iframe-wrapper">
            <img
              src="/image.png"
              alt="Moksha Candles website preview"
              loading="lazy"
              aria-hidden="true"
              class="work-screenshot"
            />
          </div>
          <a href="https://www.mokshacandles.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="preview-overlay" aria-label="Visit Moksha Candles website"></a>
        </div>
        <div class="work-info">
          <span class="work-tag">E-Commerce</span>
          <h3>Moksha Candles</h3>
          <p>E-commerce store for a handcrafted candle brand. Premium product-forward design built to convert browsers into buyers.</p>
          <a href="https://www.mokshacandles.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-blue work-visit-btn">Visit Site &rarr;</a>
        </div>
      </article>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- REVIEWS -->
<section class="reviews-section" id="reviews">
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="sec-head">
      <p class="label">Client reviews</p>
      <h2>What our clients say</h2>
    </header>

    <div class="reviews-slider" id="reviewsSlider" aria-label="Client reviews carousel">
      <div class="reviews-track" id="reviewsTrack">

        <article class="review-card">
          <div class="review-stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.07 3.292a1 1 0 00.95.69h3.462c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-2.8 2.034a1 1 0 00-.364 1.118l1.07 3.292c.3.921-.755 1.688-1.54 1.118l-2.8-2.034a1 1 0 00-1.175 0l-2.8 2.034c-.784.57-1.838-.197-1.539-1.118l1.07-3.292a1 1 0 00-.364-1.118L2.98 8.72c-.783-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h3.461a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.07-3.292z"/></svg>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.07 3.292a1 1 0 00.95.69h3.462c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-2.8 2.034a1 1 0 00-.364 1.118l1.07 3.292c.3.921-.755 1.688-1.54 1.118l-2.8-2.034a1 1 0 00-1.175 0l-2.8 2.034c-.784.57-1.838-.197-1.539-1.118l1.07-3.292a1 1 0 00-.364-1.118L2.98 8.72c-.783-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h3.461a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.07-3.292z"/></svg>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.07 3.292a1 1 0 00.95.69h3.462c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-2.8 2.034a1 1 0 00-.364 1.118l1.07 3.292c.3.921-.755 1.688-1.54 1.118l-2.8-2.034a1 1 0 00-1.175 0l-2.8 2.034c-.784.57-1.838-.197-1.539-1.118l1.07-3.292a1 1 0 00-.364-1.118L2.98 8.72c-.783-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h3.461a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.07-3.292z"/></svg>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.07 3.292a1 1 0 00.95.69h3.462c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-2.8 2.034a1 1 0 00-.364 1.118l1.07 3.292c.3.921-.755 1.688-1.54 1.118l-2.8-2.034a1 1 0 00-1.175 0l-2.8 2.034c-.784.57-1.838-.197-1.539-1.118l1.07-3.292a1 1 0 00-.364-1.118L2.98 8.72c-.783-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h3.461a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.07-3.292z"/></svg>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.07 3.292a1 1 0 00.95.69h3.462c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-2.8 2.034a1 1 0 00-.364 1.118l1.07 3.292c.3.921-.755 1.688-1.54 1.118l-2.8-2.034a1 1 0 00-1.175 0l-2.8 2.034c-.784.57-1.838-.197-1.539-1.118l1.07-3.292a1 1 0 00-.364-1.118L2.98 8.72c-.783-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h3.461a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.07-3.292z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <blockquote>
            <p>"Right Framework completely transformed our online presence. We went from barely showing up on Google to getting consistent calls from new customers every week. Best investment we've made."</p>
          </blockquote>
          <footer class="review-author">
            <div class="review-avatar" aria-hidden="true">PV</div>
            <div>
              <strong>Owner, Primeview Glass</strong>
              <span><a href="https://www.primeviewglass.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">primeviewglass.com</a></span>
            </div>
          </footer>
